o=a?"BIBLE MODE: Artist gave a Bible verse or faith topic. Build the FULL song around it. Weave their verse into lyrics. Also pick 1\u20132 OTHER Bible verses on the SAME topic/theme (tag like [Psalm 23:1] or [Romans 8:28]). Keep it musical \u2014 not a sermon essay.\n":""
